OL,5,G1200 All Creatures Great and Small
OL,6,     FThe veterinary drama returns. It's
OL,7,     FEaster 1940 and, with Tristan
OL,8,     Faway, Skeldale House is busier
OL,9,     Fthan ever. Everyone looks to the
OL,10,     Ffuture, and James tries to save a
OL,11,     Fdog from its owner.
OL,12,G1300 Murder She Wrote
OL,13,     FJessica is kidnapped and is
OL,14,     Fbrought to the offices of a
OL,15,     Fprominent businessman and
OL,16,     Fphilanthropist, but is mistaken
OL,17,     Ffor a missing informant.
