OL,5,G1400 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica goes to Ireland to
OL,7,     Fresearch her latest book, and
OL,8,     Fstays in a house that is
OL,9,     Fsupposedly haunted by a weeping
OL,10,     Fspirit; the owner fears he is
OL,11,     Fgoing to die.
OL,12,G1500 Columbo: Columbo Cries Wolf
OL,13,     FCrime mystery starring Peter Falk
OL,14,     Fand Ian Buchanan. The dishevelled
OL,15,     Fdetective tries to prove that the
OL,16,     Fflamboyant owner of a men's
OL,17,     Fmagazine murdered his business
OL,18,     Fpartner and former lover. (1990)
