OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FBen ventures to the desolate
OL,7,     Fbeauty of Utah's Canyonlands,
OL,8,     Fwhere he meets Scott, who has
OL,9,     Fbuilt his off-grid home, and
OL,10,     Fwitnesses Scott's remarkable
OL,11,     Fresilience.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen visits former army officer
OL,14,     FMark in his stunning self-build
OL,15,     Fhome on the Moroccan coast. And he
OL,16,     Flearns of Mark's family's
OL,17,     Fstruggles as they face
OL,18,     Fever-worsening drought.
